(lemon: juice) from half a lemon
(olive oil) 1 tablespoon
(garlic, pressed or finely minced) 1 clove
(salt) to taste
(pepper) to taste

::equipment

(bowl, small)

::instructions

{dressing} = (lemon: juice) + (olive oil)
    <put, in (bowl)>
    + (salt) + (pepper)
    + (garlic)
    <mix, well, before adding to salad>

::story

A dressing that goes well on lettuce or any other mixed greens.


